<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia seeks 125,000 tonnes soft wheat.</title>
<headline>Tunisia seeks 125,000 tonnes soft wheat.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia on Monday issued a tender for the purchase of five lots of 25,000 tonnes of soft wheat each, traders said.</p>
<p>Deadline to submit offers is set for Wednesday May 14 before 0830GMT.</p>
<p>Shipment dates are as follows:</p>
<p> lot		   if E.U. origin	  if U.S. origin</p>
<p> 25,000 tonnes     1-10 July		 20-30 June</p>
<p> 25,000 tonnes     10-20 July		01-10 July</p>
<p> 25,000 tonnes     01-10 August	    20-30 July</p>
<p> 25,000 tonnes     10-20 August	    01-10 August</p>
<p> 25,000 tonnes     10-20 September	 01-10 September</p>
<p>((--Tunis newsroom, 2161-787538))</p>
